    e: ['蘇聯解體標誌兩極結構終結。留意三個干擾項都是冷戰【期間】的重要事件，位置不同：馬歇爾計劃屬冷戰初期的經濟手段，韓戰是早期的代理衝突，古巴導彈危機是對峙的高峰。把冷戰的起、中、終三段事件排好次序，是這一課的基本要求。',
      'The dissolution of the Soviet Union marks the end of the bipolar structure. All three distractors are important events within the Cold War at different points: the Marshall Plan was an early economic instrument, the Korean War an early proxy conflict, and the Cuban Missile Crisis the peak of confrontation. Ordering the beginning, middle and end of the Cold War is a basic requirement of this topic.'],
